  "raw_meta_yaml": "schema_version: 1\n\ncontext:\n  version: \"0.21.0\"\n\npackage:\n  name: r-sandpaper\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://github.com/carpentries/sandpaper/archive/refs/tags/${{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: 22e27bf89b34151dad4a511bb8469833d9cc1b3dcd7afaf83dcef54d2778af5c\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n  noarch: generic\n  script: ${{ R }} CMD INSTALL --build .\n\nrequirements:\n  host:\n    - r-base\n    - r-assertthat\n    - r-callr\n    - r-cffr\n    - r-cli >=3.4.0\n    - r-commonmark\n    - r-desc\n    - r-fs >=1.5.0\n    - r-gert >=1.0.1\n    - r-gh\n    - r-glue\n    - r-httr\n    - r-knitr >=1.33\n    - r-markdown\n    - r-pegboard >=0.7.0\n    - r-pkgdown >=1.6.0\n    - r-renv >=0.14.0\n    - r-rlang >=0.4.3\n    - r-rmarkdown >=2.4\n    - r-rprojroot\n    - r-rstudioapi\n    - r-servr\n    - r-stringr\n    - r-usethis >=2.0.0\n    - r-whisker\n    - r-withr\n    - r-yaml\n    - r-r.utils\n    - r-xfun\n    - r-nanonext >=1.8.0\n  run:\n    - r-base\n    - r-assertthat\n    - r-callr\n    - r-cffr\n    - r-cli >=3.4.0\n    - r-commonmark\n    - r-desc\n    - r-fs >=1.5.0\n    - r-gert >=1.0.1\n    - r-gh\n    - r-glue\n    - r-httr\n    - r-knitr >=1.33\n    - r-markdown\n    - r-pegboard >=0.7.0\n    - r-pkgdown >=1.6.0\n    - r-renv >=0.14.0\n    - r-rlang >=0.4.3\n    - r-rmarkdown >=2.4\n    - r-rprojroot\n    - r-rstudioapi\n    - r-servr\n    - r-stringr\n    - r-usethis >=2.0.0\n    - r-whisker\n    - r-withr\n    - r-yaml\n    - r-r.utils\n    - r-xfun\n    - r-nanonext >=1.8.0\n\ntests:\n  - r:\n      libraries:\n        - sandpaper\n  - files:\n      source:\n        - tests/\n    requirements:\n      run:\n        - git\n        - r-testthat\n        - r-mockr\n        - r-sessioninfo\n        - r-varnish\n    script:\n      # rattler-build normalizes LANG/LC_ALL to C.UTF-8, which makes gettext\n      # ignore language switching and fails sandpaper's translation tests,\n      # so restore a real locale (shipped with the CI docker images)\n      - export LANG=en_US.UTF-8 LC_ALL=en_US.UTF-8\n      # use R -e (not Rscript): Rscript implies --no-echo, which makes\n      # renv >=1.2 load projects quietly and fails a sandpaper test that\n      # expects renv startup output\n      - R -e \"testthat::test_file('tests/testthat.R', stop_on_failure=TRUE)\"\n\nabout:\n  license: MIT\n  summary: Create and Curate Carpentries Lessons\n  description: |\n    The {sandpaper} package was created by\n    [The Carpentries](https://carpentries.org) to re-imagine our method of\n    creating lesson websites for our workshops.\n    This package will take a series of\n    [Markdown](https://www.markdownguide.org/getting-started/) or\n    [RMarkdown](https://rmarkdown.rstudio.com/) files and generate a static\n    website with the features and styling of The Carpentries lessons\n    including customized layouts and callout blocks.\n    Much of the functionality in this package is inspired by\n    [Jenny Bryan's](https://jennybryan.org/) work with the\n    [{usethis}](https://usethis.r-lib.org/) package.\n  license_file:\n    - ${{ PREFIX }}/lib/R/share/licenses/MIT\n    - LICENSE\n  homepage: https://carpentries.github.io/sandpaper/\n  repository: https://github.com/carpentries/sandpaper/\n  documentation: https://carpentries.github.io/sandpaper/\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - conda-forge/r\n    - matthewfeickert\n",
